sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant S as create-my-skill
  participant V as visualize-skill-workflow
  participant C as commit
  participant M as commit-message
  U->>S: Create or update skill
  S->>V: If skill calls skills: diagram
  V-->>S: Mermaid source and SVG
  S->>C: Commit skill changes
  C->>M: Write staged-change message
  M-->>C: Commit message
  C-->>S: Hash and subject
  S-->>U: Done
